# SBMO negative test N2, Case02 (expected result: INCONSISTENT with the SBMO 1.1
# dimension-level disjointness; CONSISTENT with SBMO 1.0, which lacked it).
# Imports the validated A-Box unchanged and adds one deliberately wrong
# assertion: the freemium pricing-strategy value of Case02 is also used as a
# revenue source. The range of hasRevenueSource makes it a RevenueSource, its
# asserted type makes it a PricingStrategy, and the two are disjoint.
@prefix sbmo: <https://rafaelc-rb.github.io/sbmo#> .
@prefix ex: <https://rafaelc-rb.github.io/sbmo/abox#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<https://rafaelc-rb.github.io/sbmo/tests/case02-negative-test-misused-value> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://rafaelc-rb.github.io/sbmo/abox> .

ex:Case02 sbmo:hasRevenueSource ex:Case02_FreemiumPricing .
